 crunchy biscuits and juicy chicken legs to keep its tail wagging. Toss a ball or toy bone to play together and watch its excitement burst into life. When it calms down, reach out to gently pet its head or give a belly rub\u2014it\u2019ll lean in with pure happiness. Every touch, every snack, and every game strengthens your bond. Bring this warm-hearted Labrador into your space and experience the joy of true companionship!", "short_description": "Play, feed, and cuddle your cheerful Brown Labrador\u2014pure warmth in mixed reality!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/eb8115ab-f129-4bc3-b08c-a6ffa3121d5a", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://game.lvcn.net/MyPuppyBrownLabrador/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24476261232045671"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1579561530165934"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1529511568234394"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1529511568234394"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1771005600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1579561530165934"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24476988145306313